  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the kazan cauldron to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Brush the paratha layers with a mixture of ghee and cumin powder.",
    "Layer the paratha, smoked haddock, and yogurt mixture in the kazan, finishing with a layer of paratha on top.",
    "Brush the top layer of paratha with the remaining ghee mixture.",
    "Cover the kazan with a lid and cook for 20 minutes.",
    "Uncover and continue cooking for an additional 10-12 minutes, until the paratha is golden brown.",
    "Remove from heat and garnish with chopped cilantro.",
    "Serve hot, with a side of chutney or raita, if desired."
